				"Unlike most &9ME Network&r devices, the &cM&6E &aC&9o&bn&5t&cr&6o&el&al&9e&br&r does not require channels, rather it emits them 8 or 32 per side, depending how many channels the device supports."
				""
				"The &cM&6E &aC&9o&bn&5t&cr&6o&el&al&9e&br&r requires 6 AE/t per controller block to function. Each ME Controller block can store 8000 AE, so larger networks might require additional energy storage."
