				"多区块控制器可以以相当自由的形式建造，但有几个规则必须遵守："
				""
				"• All &cM&6E &aC&9o&bn&5t&cr&6o&el&al&9e&br&r blocks on a ME Network must be connected; else the blocks will turn red."
				""
				"• The size of the &cM&6E &aC&9o&bn&5t&cr&6o&el&al&9e&br&r must be within 7x7x7; else it will turn &cred&r."
				""
				"• A &cM&6E &aC&9o&bn&5t&cr&6o&el&al&9e&br&r can have 2 adjacent blocks in at most 1 axis; if a block violates this rule, it will disable and turn white."
				""
